span></a><span aria-hidden="true"></span><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-[1.55] text-(--color-ink-500) max-w-[58ch]">Status, oil, vessels, carriers, insurance: the full dashboard.</p></div><div class="mt-10 md:mt-14"><p class="eyebrow mb-5 md:mb-6">Or jump to</p><ul class="border-t hairline"><li class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[260px_1fr] gap-x-8 gap-y-1 py-5 md:py-6 border-b hairline"><a class="display-row text-(--color-ink) text-[18px] md:text-[19px] leading-tight hover:text-(--color-alert) transition-colors whitespace-nowrap" href="/is-the-strait-of-hormuz-open">Is it open?<span aria-hidden="true"> →</span></a><p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.55] text-(--color-ink-500) max-w-[60ch]">One-line live answer with the supporting indicators.</p></li><li class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[260px_1fr] gap-x-8 gap-y-1 py-5 md:py-6 border-b hairline"><a class="display-row text-(--color-ink) text-[18px] md:text-[19px] leading-tight hover:text-(--color-alert) transition-colors whitespace-nowrap" href="/methodology">Methodology<span aria-hidden="true"> →</span></a><p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.55] text-(--color-ink-500) max-w-[60ch]">Every indicator with its source, cadence, and limitations.</p></li><li class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[260px_1fr] gap-x-8 gap-y-1 py-5 md:py-6 border-b hairline"><a class="display-row text-(--color-ink) text-[18px] md:text-[19px] leading-tight hover:text-(--color-alert) transition-colors whitespace-nowrap" href="/faq">FAQ<span aria-hidden="true"> →</span></a><p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.55] text-(--color-ink-500) max-w-[60ch]">Common questions about the crisis and how to use the data.</p></li><li class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[260px_1fr] gap-x-8 gap-y-1 py-5 md:py-6 border-b hairline"><a class="display-row text-(--color-ink) text-[18px] md:text-[19px] leading-tight hover:text-(--color-alert) transition-colors whitespace-nowrap" href="/regions">Country exposure<span aria-hidden="true"> →</span></a><p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.55] text-(--color-ink-500) max-w-[60ch]">Per-country dependency and reserve detail.</p></li><li class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[260px_1fr] gap-x-8 gap-y-1 py-5 md:py-6 border-b hairline"><a class="display-row text-(--color-ink) text-[18px] md:text-[19px] leading-tight hover:text-(--color-alert) transition-colors whitespace-nowrap" href="/embed">Embed<span aria-hidden="true"> →</span></a><p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.55] text-(--color-ink-500) max-w-[60ch]">Drop the live status badge into any article.</p></li><li class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[260px_1fr] gap-x-8 gap-y-1 py-5 md:py-6 border-b hairline"><a class="display-row text-(--color-ink) text-[18px] md:text-[19px] leading-tight hover:text-(--color-alert) transition-colors whitespace-nowrap" href="/api">API<span aria-hidden="true"> →</span></a><p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.55] text-(--color-ink-500) max-w-[60ch]">Free summary JSON, CSV, and RSS feeds, no key.</p></li></ul></div><p class="mt-12 md:mt-16 text-[14px] leading-[1.6] text-(--color-ink-500) max-w-[58ch]">If a link from somewhere else on the web brought you here and you think it should still work, drop a note to<!-- --> <a href="mailto:hello@straits.live" class="underline decoration-(--color-rule-strong) hover:decoration-(--color-ink) underline-offset-4 text-(--color-ink)">hello@straits.live</a> <!-- -->and we’ll add a redirect.</p></div></main><footer aria-label="Site footer" class="bg-(--color-paper-2) border-t hairline-strong"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1280px] px-6 md:px-12 pt-16 pb-6"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-12 gap-y-10 sm:gap-y-12 gap-x-4 sm:gap-x-6 md:gap-x-8"><div class="sm:col-span-2 md:col-span-4"><p class="display-mark text-(--color-ink) text-[26px] md:text-[30px] leading-none">Straits</p><p class="mt-5 text-[14px] md:text-[15px] leading-[1.6] text-(--color-ink-700) max-w-[36ch]">An independent open-source intelligence project. Free to read, free to embed, and free to query the summary API. No login, no ad networks.</p><p class="mt-4 text-[14px] md:text-[15px] leading-[1.6] text-(--color-ink-700) max-w-[36ch]">No ad networks means it runs on readers. If Straits is useful to you,<!-- --> <a href="/tip" class="underline decoration-(--color-rule-strong) hover:decoration-(--color-ink) underline-offset-2 text-(--color-ink) focus-ring">leave a tip</a> <!-- -->to help keep it independent.</p><p class="text-[14px] md:text-[15px] leading-[1.6] text-(--color-ink-700) mt-4 max-w-[36ch]">Straits runs on about<!-- --> <span class="num">$83</span> a month. No ad networks; readers are the only funding.<!-- --> <a href="/tip" class="underline decoration-(--color-rule-strong) hover:decoration-(--color-ink) underline-offset-2 text-(--color-ink) focus-ring whitespace-nowrap">Chip in →</a></p><div class="mt-7"><form class="mt-8 max-w-[360px]" noValidate=""><p class="eyebrow">Notify me</p><p class="mt-3 text-[14px] leading-[1.55] text-(--color-ink-500) text-pretty">A short email when the Strait of Hormuz status flips. No ad networks. Add the Monday digest below if you want the weekly read too.</p><label class="sr-only" for="email-capture-input">Email address</label><div class="absolute left-[-9999px]" aria-hidden="true"><label for="email-capture-website">Website</label><input id="email-capture-website" type="text" tabindex="-1" autoComplete="off" value=""/></div><div class="mt-4 flex border hairline-strong bg-(--color-paper) focus-within:border-(--color-ink) min-h-[44px]"><input id="email-capture-input" type="email" inputMode="email" autoComplete="email" required="" placeholder="you@example.com" class="num flex-1 min-w-0 px-2 sm:px-3 bg-transparent text-[14px] text-(--color-ink) placeholder:text-(--color-ink-300) outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-(--color-ink-500) focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-(--color-paper-2) disabled:opacity-60" value=""/><button type="submit" class="eyebrow px-3 sm:px-4 border-l hairline-strong hover:bg